Z||000005||Phil||01-30-2000||09:38 PM||||The molding is part of the facia and not removable. I forgot about the molding.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Standard||01-31-2000||04:05 AM||||The only part with molding that is not removable is the 86-88 GT Fastback rear fascia, so far as I know.  For the front fascia it should be held in by the 2 torx screws that also hold in the side marker light.  if I'm wrong, lmk!||||reg||1
Z||000007||Wolfhound||01-31-2000||04:32 AM||||I,m not postive but I think the 87 SE has round molding, while the 86 has the ribbed.<BR>Coy||||reg||1
