Z||000010||stsmithgt||01-31-2000||12:50 PM||||My 86GT has rounded molding.||||reg||1
Z||000011||mrfiero||01-31-2000||03:04 PM||||The SE's have the ribbed molding but can be used on GT's with the round molding.  All you need to do is cut off the ribbed part of the front fascia and the new round style sidemarker light will cover it up.  ||||reg||1
